<title>HONG KONG: China Banking Corp sets US$60 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>China Banking Corp sets US$60 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the arrangers.</p>
<p> BORROWER    CHINA BANKING CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$60 MLN  COUPON     3ML+85   MATURITY   3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRCD	 ISS PRICE  PAR	LAUNCH    17.FEB.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	 CALLS	NONE     REPLIES   06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING     NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    $250K</p>
<p> RATING	--	   SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   PHILIPPINE GOV LAW   ENGLISH   PAY DATE  21.MAR.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS    US$5 MLN+   18BP   ALL-IN  91</p>
<p>   SENIOR MGRS     US$2-4 MLN  15BP   ALL-IN  90</p>
<p> ARRANGERS    DEVELOPMENT BANK OF SINGAPORE (BOOKS), LTCB ASIA</p>
<p>		  (BOOKS, PAYING AGENT), STANDARD CHARTERED BANK AND</p>
<p>		  AFC MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p>CO-ARRANGERS DRESDNER (SOUTH EAST ASIA) AND SAKURA FINANCE ASIA NOTES  THE ISSUE HAS BEEN FULLY UNDERWRITTEN BY THE ARRANGERS</p>
<p>	  AND CO-ARRANGERS.</p>
<p>	  PROCEEDS WILL BE USED FOR GENERAL FUNDING PURPOSES.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
